                lines.append((i, j))
                covered[i][j] = True
                for k in range(len(cost_matrix)):
                    if not covered[k][j]:
                        covered[k][j] = True
                for k in range(len(cost_matrix[0])):
                    if not covered[i][k]:
                        covered[i][k] = True
    return lines
```

5.  If there are zeros not covered by the lines, then there is no solution.

